# Screenshot smoke (mandatory before "ready")

## Rule

**Never tell Steve the game or study server is ready** until Playwright screenshot smoke passes and you **paste screenshot paths** (or images) in chat.

Applies to **`npm run dev`** and **`npm run dev:study`** — study mode only disables HMR; it does **not** skip screenshot smoke.

```powershell
Set-Location C:\Users\steve\MeWorld\game
npm run dev          # or: npm run dev:study
# servers already up:
npm run smoke:differential-session
npm run smoke:play-case
```

To skip browser smoke only when debugging: `SKIP_PLAY_SMOKE=1` or `--skip-play-smoke` on `start-dev.mjs` — **not** the default for study.

## What must pass

| Script | Screenshots | Catches |
|--------|-------------|---------|
| `smoke-differential-session.mjs` | `docs/smoke-screenshots/<date>/01-welcome.png` … `06-floating-chat-open.png` | White blank differential |
| `smoke-play-case-session.mjs` | `docs/smoke-screenshots/<date>/play-case/*.png` | Black/white welcome, briefing, play, **Continue**, **The Whys**, **`?case=U01`** |

Play-case flow includes:

1. Welcome + blank-screen guards (`smoke-screen-utils.mjs`)
2. Continue panel (uber case in seeded history)
3. The Whys panel
4. Play → briefing → play scene
5. Uber **U01** deep-link (missing import / null vitals regressions)

## Study snapshot

`START-MEWORLD-STUDY.bat` runs **frozen** `MeWorld-study`. After fixes on main:

```powershell
cd C:\Users\steve\MeWorld
powershell -File scripts\create-study-snapshot.ps1
```

Black screen on study = stale snapshot or skipped smoke. Refresh snapshot; do not patch only `MeWorld-study`.

## Common failures

| Symptom | Fix |
|---------|-----|
| Black screen | `node scripts/audit-game-case-load.mjs` · uber vitals in `caseNarrative.js` · missing `gameData.js` imports |
| White screen | `npm run smoke:pre-serve` (vite build) |
| `enrichUberGameCase is not defined` | Import from `uberCases.js` in `gameData.js` |
| Study still broken after main fix | Re-run `create-study-snapshot.ps1` |

Pair with: `meworld-game-data-imports.mdc` · `play-case-chat.mdc`
